iginal individual deeds were shared with Gramercy previously in this link &nbsp;Emissions&nbsp;Kind regards&nbsp;​​​​Carolina&nbsp;Koschdoski&nbsp;de&nbsp;SouzaLegal&nbsp;DirectorThis email and any attachments are confidential and may also be privileged. If you receive this message in error, please contact the sender immediately, destroy the email and any attachments and do not use, copy, store or disclose this email and any attachments for any purpose. Pogust Goodhead does not accept service of documents by electronic means without express prior agreement.&nbsp;Pogust Goodhead is the trading name of&nbsp;PGMBM Law Ltd, a&nbsp;limited liability company registered in England and Wales (no. 6284764) with its&nbsp;registered office at&nbsp;53-64 Chancery House, Chancery Lane, London WC2A 1QS&nbsp;and authorised and regulated by the Solicitors' Regulation Authority. We use the term ‘partner’ to refer to an employee or consultant of Pogust Goodhead with equivalent standing or qualifications. No&nbsp;reference to a partner should be taken to imply partnership for the purposes of the Partnership Act 1890&nbsp;or Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2000. A list of partners is available on our website.&nbsp;For details about what personal information we collect and why, please see our Privacy Policy.From:&nbsp;Nick Paolazzi &lt;npaolazzi@gramercy.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;03 December 2025 20:22To:&nbsp;Carolina Koschdoski de Souza &lt;csouza@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Joshua Katz &lt;jkatz@gramercy.com&gt;; Marc Zelina &lt;mzelina@gramercy.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;James Taylor &lt;JTaylor@gramercy.com&gt;; Josh O'Melia &lt;jomelia@gramercy.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Joseph Moreno &lt;jmoreno@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Howard Morris &lt;hmorris@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Tom Crow &lt;tcrow@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Donatas Juskauskas &lt;djuskauskas@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Enquiry for Additional ATE Cove