ide of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.&nbsp;Dear Sarah and Sophia,&nbsp;Thanks again for your comments on the Note.&nbsp;Further to the below, I have now re-written the section at the end on ATE. It ultimately flags the same risks of not obtaining ‘full’ cover, and identifies that as the safest approach if the aim is to avoid an application, but also recognises the reasons why many firms may not want to go down that route, and notes the approach which PG/LD hav"}

