The Times&nbsp;does not change that position.
I look forward to hearing back from you regarding whether you wish to continue working on the case&nbsp;at PG&nbsp;or go onto&nbsp;paid&nbsp;leave
by return and in any event by 5pm on Monday 20 October 2025. We remain hopeful that you will agree to continue to work&nbsp;at PG&nbsp;throughout the PDD Trial.
